CM_ SG_ 2617049636 TVMS1280_Temp2_C "NOTE: TVMS1280 Voltage Input 1 candidate is currently decoded in ESPHome from 0x1BFD0224 page/mux 0x11 D2 / 10. It is expected to read near 0.0 V when the external voltage input is disconnected. This overlaps the temp/tank/status PGN and is kept as a diagnostic candidate until fully confirmed.";
CM_ SG_ 2617049636 TVMS1280_Temp1_C "NOTE: TVMS1280 Voltage Input 2 candidate is currently decoded in ESPHome from 0x1BFD0224 page/mux 0x14 D2 / 10 and has appeared around 11.9-12.0 V in logs. This overlaps the temp/tank/status PGN and is kept as a diagnostic candidate until fully confirmed.";

CM_ "TVMS1280_DIGITAL_INPUTS_NOTE: Hardware has 3 digital inputs, currently unused. No ESPHome entities or DBC signals should be added until a one-at-a-time input toggle capture confirms the PGN and bit/byte mapping.";
